    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">capture
    the industry trends and develop and launch new products and expand into relevant adjacencies in answer to such trends;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
