<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Course
Services had the highest gross margin of 99.9% among the eleven product categories whereas groceries had the lowest gross margin of 12.8%
among products sold for the year ended December 31, 2024. The gross margin of functional skincare products was 24.9% for the year ended
December 31, 2024.</FONT></P>

