<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="background-color: white">The fair value
of all assets acquired and liabilities assumed is the estimated book value of the Yundian. Goodwill represents the excess of the fair
value of purchase price over the amounts assigned to the fair value of the assets acquired and the liabilities assumed of Yundian at the
acquisition date.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The following unaudited pro forma consolidated financial
